{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing invocation-end ordering contract.** Reversing `onInvocationEnd` silently changes the documented registration-order behavior and can break plugins whose flushing or cleanup depends on earlier plugins having run first. Retain registration order, or introduce an explicit opt-in LIFO scope mechanism instead of changing all existing plugin lists.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77yjL4","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":112,"observation_digest":"a99a53b75733a6779a2211932e1b2c4c0591f8932578c5a3c519fff8fa346d6d","observation_id":"aro_v1_vgnfhn2xgothpgrccgjs4gzmjq","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-08T21:29:58Z","review_id":"arr_v1_povxmdcloccfgct74pwuugcyxz","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"18d4e3c9937570ae7a3618bb4830be440021e816","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_3mhzqknsrgjbrteqft5pzgyqdu","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T21:29:58Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
